{"id":"d09","tag":"{\"model\":\"gemini-3.5-flash\",\"variant\":\"default\",\"k\":8,\"budget\":3000,\"mcpf\":3,\"maxTokens\":1024}","split":"dev","type":"flow","question":"Bagaimana ky menegakkan batas ukuran respons (maxResponseSize)?","status":"answer","answer":"Ky menegakkan batas ukuran respons (`maxResponseSize`) melalui fungsi `limitResponseSize` dengan memanfaatkan `TransformStream` untuk mengawasi jumlah byte stream respons saat dibaca [F7:17","cites":"","valid_cites":0,"unverified":0,"uncited":1,"refused":0,"refused_correct":"","false_refusal":0,"context_has_ref":1,"context_ref_recall":0.5,"cite_hits_ref":0,"cite_ref_recall":0,"tokens_in":1524,"tokens_out":41,"usage_source":"provider","latency_ms":8392,"nilai_manual":"","catatan":""}
{"id":"d10","tag":"{\"model\":\"gemini-3.5-flash\",\"variant\":\"default\",\"k\":8,\"budget\":3000,\"mcpf\":3,\"maxTokens\":1024}","split":"dev","type":"flow","question":"Bagaimana ky memvalidasi hasil JSON dengan schema dan galat apa yang dilempar bila gagal?","status":"answer","answer":"Berikut adalah penjelasan tentang bagaimana Ky memvalidasi hasil JSON dengan skema (schema) dan galat (error) yang dilempar jika terjadi kegagalan:\n\n### 1. Cara Ky Memvalidasi Hasil JSON dengan Schema\n\nProses validasi dilakukan melalui fungsi `validateJsonWithSchema` [F1:329-346]:\n\n1. **Pemeriksaan Skema:** Ky memeriksa apakah skema yang diberikan memenuhi spesifikasi Standard Schema dengan mengambil properti `~standard` dari objek atau fungsi skema [F1:330](format sitasi tidak valid).\n2. **Validasi","cites":"source/core/Ky.ts:329-346","valid_cites":1,"unverified":1,"uncited":0,"refused":0,"refused_correct":"","false_refusal":0,"context_has_ref":1,"context_ref_recall":0.667,"cite_hits_ref":1,"cite_ref_recall":0.333,"tokens_in":1429,"tokens_out":123,"usage_source":"provider","latency_ms":6467,"nilai_manual":"","catatan":""}
{"id":"d11","tag":"{\"model\":\"gemini-3.5-flash\",\"variant\":\"default\",\"k\":8,\"budget\":3000,\"mcpf\":3,\"maxTokens\":1024}","split":"dev","type":"flow","question":"Bagaimana ky melaporkan progres unggahan (onUploadProgress)?","status":"answer","answer":"Ky melaporkan progres unggahan (`onUploadProgress`) melalui alur berikut:\n\n1. **Pemeriksaan Dukungan dan Syarat Request**:\n   * Metode `#wrapRequestWithUploadProgress` pada `Ky` akan mengecek apakah callback `onUploadProgress` disediakan, `supportsRequestStreams` didukung, dan `request.body` ada [F2:1369-1371].\n   ","cites":"source/core/Ky.ts:1369-1371","valid_cites":1,"unverified":0,"uncited":0,"refused":0,"refused_correct":"","false_refusal":0,"context_has_ref":1,"context_ref_recall":0.667,"cite_hits_ref":1,"cite_ref_recall":0.333,"tokens_in":1948,"tokens_out":88,"usage_source":"provider","latency_ms":6281,"nilai_manual":"","catatan":""}
{"id":"d13","tag":"{\"model\":\"gemini-3.5-flash\",\"variant\":\"default\",\"k\":8,\"budget\":3000,\"mcpf\":3,\"maxTokens\":1024}","split":"dev","type":"callers","question":"Di mana TimeoutError dibuat atau dilempar?","status":"answer","answer":"Berdasarkan kode yang diberikan, `TimeoutError` dibuat dan dilempar pada beberapa lokasi berikut:\n\n1. **Pendefinisian Kelas (`TimeoutError`)**:\n   - Didefinisikan sebagai turunan dari `KyError` pada berkas `source/errors/TimeoutError.ts` [F5:8-14].\n\n2. **Lokasi Pelemparan/Pembuatan Instansi `TimeoutError`**:\n   - **`source/core/Ky.ts`**:\n     - Pada metode `#getErrorDataTimeout()`, dilempar dengan `throw new TimeoutError(request)` jika `remainingTotal === 0` [F2:857-859].\n     - Pada metode `#getEffectiveTimeout()`, dilempar dengan `throw new TimeoutError(this.#sentRequest)` jika `remainingTotal === 0` [F3:870-872].\n   - **`source/utils/timeout.ts`**:\n     - Pada fungsi `timeout()`, dilempar (melalui pemanggilan `reject()`) menggunakan `new TimeoutError(request)` di dalam *callback* `setTimeout` saat batas waktu permintaan terlampaui [F6:21-27].","cites":"source/errors/TimeoutError.ts:8-14 | source/core/Ky.ts:857-859 | source/core/Ky.ts:870-872 | source/utils/timeout.ts:21-27","valid_cites":4,"unverified":0,"uncited":0,"refused":0,"refused_correct":"","false_refusal":0,"context_has_ref":1,"context_ref_recall":0.2,"cite_hits_ref":1,"cite_ref_recall":0.2,"tokens_in":1375,"tokens_out":264,"usage_source":"provider","latency_ms":5612,"nilai_manual":"","catatan":""}
